    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm doing some timber framing for a loft addition in my house. i'm looking at using a douglas fir beam for the main span. i need to figure out how much weight it can actually take before the deflection gets too bad. what should i be looking at for the calculations?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
